      "writtenOn": "2018-07-31T16:08:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "instead of #ifdef CR50_DEV I suggest having a separate is_writing_sn_allowed() function.\nThat function shall return 1 only if we are in RMA/factory mode - outside of this mode setting SN is not allowed even if it is not set yet. Plus, it can also return 1 if defined(CR50_DEV).\nIf for now we don\u0027t have a method to check if we are in factory/RMA, then ifdef CR50_DEV there is the only case for 1, but that should change.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 113,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 113,
        "endChar": 15
      },
      "revId": "6da48806957840e89e3cc5d11df7bdf0e01c67d9",
