        "id": 1256783
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-08-02T09:11:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good point, though I think perhaps the check you\u0027re describing should be added to the vendor command above? (where I currently have nothing..)\n\nI don\u0027t think factory/RMA would ever have a use for setting the sn bits on the console (seems too error-prone?) so I was mainly having this as a dev utility that could be removed from the prod image to save space. I believe this is the same as the approach used for board id.\n\nWhat do you think?",
      "parentUuid": "792c5948_d34557a5",
